      "content": "that's a good start. i like the shaman thing. to really drive home the contrast with the 'enlightened' empire, id like to lean more into their physical appearance and how they carry themselves. i want them to feel almost sub-human or like they're driven more by instinct than reason. could you describe their physical traits and maybe how they look when they're in a crowd? i'm thinking something that looks a bit more 'wild' or 'primitive' to make them feel truly alien to the civilized people.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
